## 2. Standard Length Convention & Audit Matrix

| Category / Field Type | Target Fields | `min_length` | `max_length` | Notes / Rationale |
| :--- | :--- | :---: | :---: | :--- |
| **Person Names** | `full_name`, `complainant_name` | — | `100` | Standard name boundary |
| **Contact Numbers** | `contact_number` | — | `11` | PH mobile/landline digit format |
| **Email Addresses** | `email` | — | `254` | RFC 5321 standard max length |
| **Street Addresses** | `address` | — | `300` | Detailed location strings |
| **Product / Business Names** | `product_name`, `manufacturer`, `place_of_purchase` | `2` | `150` or `300` | Required short text inputs |
| **Free-Text Notes & Reasons** | `notes_to_fda`, `nature_of_complaint`, `response_notes`, `unregistered_reason`, `rejection_reason`, `field_operation_notes` | `10` | `2000` | Free-text fields (2000 char cap) |
| **Search & Query Params** | `search` query parameters | — | `150` | Prevents regex/DB search overload |
| **IDs & Official Codes** | `cpr_number`, `product_code` | — | `100` | Government registration identifiers |

